# vendor/libgit2/BUCK
#
# libgit2 1.9.2 - Git library
# 
# Configuration:
#   - Linux/musl, x86_64
#   - LibreSSL for TLS/HTTPS and SHA256
#   - SHA1 collision detection (built-in)
#   - Bundled: zlib, pcre, xdiff, llhttp
#   - SSH via exec (no libssh2)

# =============================================================================
# Bundled dependencies
# =============================================================================

